(H + offset + 360) % 360 is the safe way to cycle HSL hues—avoiding negatives or values > 360.","target":{"path":"/lessons/03","hash":"#ch-3-7","query":{"tab-7":"code"}}},"160":{"title":"3.7 Vivid + Low-Sat Palette Generator","breadcrumb":"Ch 3 · Color","kind":"code","text":"function genPalette(H, S, L) {
